grignard1=pathway('grignard-ketone','Ketone + RMgX → tertiary alcohol','Propanone','CC(C)=O','1. CH₃MgBr, dry ether; 2. H₃O⁺','tert-Butanol','CC(C)(C)O','Grignard carbon nucleophilic છે. Ketone ના carbonyl carbon પર addition નવું C–C bond બનાવે છે; work-up પછી tertiary alcohol મળે છે.',org_steps,'A ketone already has two carbon groups; adding a third carbon substituent gives a tertiary alcohol.','Achiral example; a prochiral unsymmetrical ketone needs facial-selectivity analysis.','Do not add aqueous acid before the C–C bond-forming stage.')
