chapter('ammonia','NH₃ lone-pair nitrogen nucleophile પણ છે અને dissolving-metal reduction માં solvent/proton-donor medium પણ બની શકે છે. Co-reagent metal હોય કે acyl chloride હોય તે જોઈને role નક્કી કરો.','NH₃: N attacks acyl C; metal supplies reducing electrons.','An electron-pair nucleophile in acyl substitution is different from a single-electron metal reductant.',[nhred,nhacyl,nhanhyd],'Where do the reducing electrons come from in Li/liquid NH₃ alkyne reduction?','The lithium metal',['Only ammonia nitrogen','Acetate ion','Molecular oxygen'])
hb_steps=steps(('Concerted B–H addition','Alkene π electrons B ના vacant orbital સાથે interact કરે છે અને B–H bond H transfer કરે છે.','Alkene π pair','Boron vacant orbital'),('Set regiochemistry','Less hindered carbon પર B attachment સામાન્ય રીતે favor થાય છે; H અને B same face થી add થાય છે.','B–H / C=C system','Syn organoborane'),('Peroxide attack and migration','Alkaline peroxide boron પર attack કરે છે; C–B group oxygen પર migrate થાય છે with retention at migrating carbon.','Peroxide O lone pair / C–B bond','Boron then adjacent O'),('Hydrolyze','C–B to C–O conversion અને hydrolysis alcohol આપે છે; alkyne-derived enol પછી tautomerize થાય છે.','B–O / hydrolytic system','Alcohol or enol'))
bh1=pathway('bh3-alkene','Hydroboration–oxidation of alkene','Propene','CC=C','1. BH₃·THF; 2. H₂O₂ / OH⁻','Propan-1-ol','CCCO','Concerted hydroboration માં B less substituted carbon અને H more substituted carbon પર add થાય છે. Oxidation પછી B ને OH replace કરે છે; free carbocation નથી.',hb_steps,'Steric and electronic effects favor B delivery to the less substituted carbon.','Overall anti-Markovnikov hydration with syn H/OH relationship for suitable stereochemical substrates.','Do not draw the Markovnikov alcohol for standard hydroboration–oxidation.')
bh2=pathway('bh3-alkyne','Terminal alkyne → aldehyde','But-1-yne','CCC#C','Bulky dialkylborane; then H₂O₂ / OH⁻','Butanal','CCCC=O','Selective mono-hydroboration માટે disiamylborane અથવા suitable bulky borane commonly વપરાય છે. Oxidation vinylborane ને enol માં ફેરવે છે; tautomerization aldehyde આપે છે.',hb_steps,'B at the terminal carbon leads to terminal enol OH; keto–enol tautomerism then gives aldehyde.','Final aldehyde is planar; any intermediate enol geometry is not a permanent E/Z label on the aldehyde.','Unmodified BH₃ can overreact; do not ignore the bulky-borane qualification.')
bh3=pathway('bh3-acid','Carboxylic acid → primary alcohol','Propanoic acid','CCC(=O)O','BH₃ complex; then work-up','Propan-1-ol','CCCO','Borane carboxylic acid સાથે acid–base/coordination interaction કરે છે. Boron-bound intermediates અને hydride transfers carbonyl reduce કરે છે; work-up alcohol release કરે છે.',hydride_steps('Carboxylic acids have a special acid–base/coordination interaction with borane.'),'The acid–borane interaction underlies useful selectivity relative to some other carbonyl groups.','No new stereocenter.','NaBH₄ under ordinary conditions is not the equivalent reagent for a carboxylic acid.')
chapter('borane','BH₃ electron-deficient boron reagent છે. Alkene hydroboration અને acid reduction અલગ uses છે; terminal alkyne માટે monoaddition/selectivity સુધારવા bulky boranes ખાસ નોંધવા.','B goes to the less substituted end; oxidation replaces B by O.','Acid-catalyzed alkene hydration usually gives a different regioisomer; terminal alkyne Hg²⁺ hydration gives a methyl ketone.',[bh1,bh2,bh3],'Which alcohol is expected from standard hydroboration–oxidation of propene?','Propan-1-ol',['Propan-2-ol','tert-Butanol','Phenol'],'https://openstax.org/books/organic-chemistry/pages/8-5-hydration-of-alkenes-addition-of-h2o-by-hydroboration')
